<title>SOUTH AFRICA: WitNigel Q1 net loss pre-capex shrinks.</title>
<headline>WitNigel Q1 net loss pre-capex shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net loss before capital spending</p>
<p>					  0.08  vs 0.233</p>
<p>    Capital recoupment	    0.91  vs none</p>
<p>    Net income from mining	0.04  vs 0.04</p>
<p>    Clean up and rents	    0.14  vs 0.16</p>
<p>    Expenses			  0.26  vs 0.44</p>
<p>Full name: Witwatersrand Nigel Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm is continuing talks for the sale of its assets.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
